          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-base text-slate-700 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Chalky white spots or horizontal yellow-brown streaks on front teeth.</li>
            <li>Uneven tooth shade or pitting on the front enamel surface.</li>
            <li>Stubborn dark stains that do not improve with regular brushing.</li>
            <li>Feeling hesitant to smile in photos or family gatherings because of tooth colour.</li>
