          <ol class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-base text-slate-700 list-decimal pl-5">
            <li><strong>Shade &amp; Depth Check:</strong> Dr. Shubham Gupta examines whether the discolouration is superficial (outer stains) or deeper within enamel (mild, moderate, or severe fluorosis).</li>
            <li><strong>Scaling &amp; Polishing:</strong> Surface deposits and outer stains are cleaned first using ultrasonic scaling.</li>
            <li><strong>Targeted Aesthetic Care:</strong> Mild spots may improve with gentle enamel polishing or microabrasion; deeper brown patches are masked smoothly using thin layers of tooth-coloured composite bonding or custom ceramic veneers/crowns where enamel is brittle.</li>
            <li><strong>Finishing &amp; Bite Check:</strong> Surfaces are contoured and polished for a natural, comfortable finish.</li>
